# Skyforge — Act III: The Foreman (40 quests, Turn 2 part 1).
# TONE: Steampunk colonial. Erik Brassgrip arrives. The colony is
# founded. Citizens are colleagues — Builder, Forester, Cook, Miner,
# Smith, Guard. The Charter audits happiness, not just output.
# THEME BIBLE: Create + MineColonies grow together. Domum Ornamentum
# dresses the colony; Mechanical Arm + Deployer give the Foreman
# their first automated colleague.
# TODO verify all icon + task item IDs at NeoForge 21.1 mod versions.

